## Next development gate

Phases 1–4 are Owner-accepted. Owner approved P5-004 and compatibility proposal (ADR-027). Delivered bounded category-first creation, structured Skill attributes, reference packs and local category-icon preparation, preserving legacy data and evidence. Phase 5 remains pending independent reviewer/CEO review and Owner acceptance; Phase 6 and in-app dictionary authoring are not authorized.

## Record maintenance

Update this summary from explicit Owner decisions and verified evidence. Preserve original historical documents and distinguish requirements, reported history, observed code, executed tests and Owner acceptance. No push, release, deployment or browser-data reset is implied.


